OL,3,GNEWSAGuide to Remembrance services
OL,4,Aacross county
OL,5,
OL,6,FArmed forces personnel will be honoured
OL,7,Fat Remembrance Sunday services across
OL,8,FLeicester, Leicestershire and Rutland.
OL,10,FThousands of people, including veterans
OL,11,Fand current service personnel, will
OL,12,Fattend events, with many involved in a
OL,13,Fparade ahead of the nationwide
OL,14,Ftwo-minute silence at 11:00 GMT on
OL,15,FSunday.
OL,17,FA service will be held in Leicester
OL,18,Falong with events in other towns and
OL,19,Fvillages, with road closures and
OL,20,Fchanges to parking also set to be
OL,21,Fbrought in.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
